# Not committed on purpose: a lockfile generated on Windows omits the optional
# native bindings that Linux CI needs (vite/rolldown, @rolldown/binding-*).
# npm ci then succeeds but vite crashes with "Cannot find native binding".
# CI resolves dependencies fresh with `npm install --legacy-peer-deps`.
